'''Kaijin Enemies''' (怪人, ''Kaijin'') are a type of [[Enemy Units|Enemy Unit]] introduced in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] and found in the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]] event.

No units have abilities that specifically affect Kaijin, but the [[Red Strike (Combo)|Red Strike]] [[Cat Combo]] increases [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]]' damage against Kaijin by 2.5x and reduces damage taken from them to 0.4x. 

Like [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]], [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] and [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]], Kaijin is not considered a trait, but always overlaps with one of the standard enemy types.

==Trivia==
*The word 怪人 ''kaijin'' literally translates to "mystery person" or "strange person", but in ''[[wikipedia:Tokusatsu|tokusatsu]]'' contexts it usually refers to supervillains or monsters.
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], all of the [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] Kaijin enemies ([[Madam Peng]], [[Countess Koryessa]] and [[High Countess Koryessa]]) wear red lipstick, whereas in every other version it's black.
**This change was likely to prevent them from resembling blackface, a practice originating in American theater in which performers would heavily darken their skin and exaggerate their lips (usually via applying bright red or pink lipstick) to portray a highly offensive caricature of Africans.
*[[13th Anniv. Doge Cake]] is the only non-Kaijin enemy introduced in the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]].

